<p>Written for Pride Month 2019! 🏳️‍🌈</p>
<hr />
<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><strong><em>Hell hath no limits, nor is circumscribed in one self place. For where we are is hell, <span style="color: red"><span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><span style="color:black">and where hell is must we ever be.</span></span></span></em></strong></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p>I got several question during the drafting process about the inclusion of SCP-113. Its inclusion serves to indicate to the reader that Hayes is transfemale, and that she has experiences with gender dysphoria. Given that SCP-4175's condition loosely parallels these experiences, she becomes inclined to help him transition to the afterlife.</p>
<p>Hope you all enjoyed! Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1566935860" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;">FloppyPhoenix</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calamitous1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4780073); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4780073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1566935860" alt="calamitous1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4780073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calamitous1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4780073); return false;">calamitous1</a></span> for providing feedback!</p>

